% Special-relativistic shock tube (Marti & Mueller problem 1; Lupi 2023): rho0 10|1, P 40/3|1e-6, at rest, adiabatic index 5/3.
% 1D periodic box of length 2, discontinuities at x = 1 and at the wrap; the comparison uses the window 0.5 < x < 1.5.
% Geometric units (G = c = 1): the problem is scale-free, UnitMass_in_g only sets the cgs conversion.
InitCondFile                       grhd_shocktube_ics
ICFormat                           3
OutputDir                          output
TimeLimitCPU                       900
PartAllocFactor                    2.0
TimeBegin                          0
TimeMax                            0.3
ComovingIntegrationOn              0
BoxSize                            2
OutputListOn                       0
TimeOfFirstSnapshot                0
TimeBetSnapshot                    0.1
MaxSizeTimestep                    0.001
MinSizeTimestep                    1e-14
DesNumNgb                          4
MaxNumNgbDeviation                 0.05
UnitMass_in_g                      1
SofteningGas                       0.0001
ErrTolIntAccuracy                  0.0025
CourantFac                         0.2
TimeBetStatistics                  0.01
MaxRMSDisplacementFac              0.125
ErrTolTheta                        0.7
ErrTolForceAcc                     0.0025
ResubmitOn                         0
ResubmitCommand                    none
